// src/v4/extdeps/coordination.dag
//
// Scope: Multi-program coordination — distributed deployment + sync/async/stream/pubsub semantics.
// Anchor: this PR conversation + memory: feedback_construction_over_ratchets (substrate-extension caution; coordination is effect-typed not behavior-typed); THESIS:215-221 omni-emission
//
// Owns:
//   - Endpoint { address: NetworkAddress, language: LanguageRef, framework: Option<FrameworkRef> }
//   - DeploymentUnit { endpoints: List<Endpoint>, wire_contracts: List<WireContract> }
//   - WireContract { from: Endpoint, to: Endpoint, semantics: CoordinationSemantics }
//   - CoordinationSemantics = Sync | Async | Stream | PubSub | EventuallyConsistent (closed enum)
//   - These are TYPED CARRIERS over existing 5 L1 behaviors (per IN-B decision);
//     NO 6th behavior introduced — coordination is Bind composition + Effect annotation
//   - Effect types per coordination kind (HttpEffect / QueueEffect / StreamEffect / etc.)
//
// Consumes:
//   - std/node.dag, std/diagnostic.dag, std/collection.dag
//   - extdeps/languages/*.dag (per-endpoint language)
//   - extdeps/frameworks/*.dag (per-endpoint framework, optional)
//
